OL,3,GNEWSA'Visibly dusty' emergency
OL,4,Adepartment told to improve
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 'visibly dusty' hospital emergency
OL,7,Fdepartment has been told it still needs
OL,8,Fto improve by a watchdog.
OL,10,FAn unannounced inspection took place at
OL,11,FCumberland Infirmary, in Carslisle,
OL,12,Fover two days in February, followed by
OL,13,Fanother visit on 18 March.
OL,15,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC),
OL,16,Fwhich subsequently issued a warning
OL,17,Fnotice to the trust in April, said it
OL,18,Ffound some areas of the department were
OL,19,F"unclean" and people were facing
OL,20,F"lengthy" waits.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
