OL,3,GNEWSA'Visibly dusty' emergency
OL,4,Adepartment told to improve
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe North Cumbria Integrated care NHS
OL,7,FFoundation Trust (NCIC) said it was
OL,8,Fmaking improvements to facilities. It
OL,9,Fadded the department, which was
OL,10,Foriginally designed for about 30,000
OL,11,Fpatients a year, was now seeing 70,000.
